    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both signed and unsigned types can be used, e.g <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_packed_vector_1a3849acfead17a2212a7142f1811af9f2" kindref="member">PackedVector&lt;signed, 2&gt;</ref><sp/>vec;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> will create a vector accepting values -2, -1, 0, 1. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_any" kindref="compound">Any</ref> other value will hit an assertion. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
